Cell["\<\
To transform a TN that is not pairwise/binary, one can add symbolic \
delta-product tensor at the right places\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9760681050816393`*^9, 3.976068121406905*^9}, {
  3.9760684208238773`*^9, 3.9760684452668056`*^9}, {3.976068593662964*^9, 
